    "faq": {
      "type": "suntneew-pdp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "fit": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Can G24 replace a Group 31 battery?", "answer": "<p>Only if the planned battery bay, hold-down, terminal orientation and cable route suit the smaller 260 × 170 × 212mm G24 enclosure. Both batteries are 12.8V 100Ah, but their physical cases are different; measure the actual installation before ordering.</p>"}},
        "dimensions": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Are the stated dimensions including the terminals?", "answer": "<p>No. The 260 × 170 × 212mm dimensions exclude the terminals. Allow additional clearance for terminal hardware, cable lugs, covers and bend radius.</p>"}},
        "current": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Can the battery continuously supply 100A?", "answer": "<p>The current product data lists 100A as the maximum continuous charge and discharge rating. The practical system limit also depends on conductors, protection devices, connections, inverter and connected equipment.</p>"}},
        "starting": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Can this battery start an engine?", "answer": "<p>No. This is a deep-cycle auxiliary battery and is not intended to start a vehicle, boat engine or other device. Do not use it as a starting battery.</p>"}},
        "charger": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Can I use an automotive lead-acid charger?", "answer": "<p>Only if the charger documentation explicitly supports the required LiFePO4 voltage profile and current limits. Do not assume every lead-acid charger is compatible.</p>"}},
        "temperature": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "What happens when the battery is too cold to charge?", "answer": "<p>Low-temperature charging protection stops battery charging below 0°C and resumes above 5°C battery temperature. This protection does not change the specified charging, discharge, storage or installation limits in the manual.</p>"}},
        "documents": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "Which certificates and files are relevant to G24?", "answer": "<p>The FCC SDoC and EMC certificate identify G24 among their listed models. The RoHS report covers the RV battery series. The IP65 and FCC Grant files are published as confirmed G24/G31 shared-design references; their original documents retain the G31 model and legacy-grantee information.</p>"}},
        "support": {"type": "question", "settings": {"question": "What do 24/7 Support and 5-Year Service mean?", "answer": "<p>24/7 Support covers product setup, charging, Bluetooth, installation and after-sales questions. 5-Year Service describes the after-sales service period; it should not be read as a separate ten-year warranty statement.</p>"}}
      },
